 "title": "Kids Magician | Marta's Magic Kids Show | Dublin",
 "text": "Home\n\nAbout\n\nGallery\n\nContact\n\nTestimonials\n\nWhat's Up?\n\nHey! I’m Magic Marta! \n\nWelcome to my magical world of MAGIC, LAUGHTER & FUN!\n\nAs a full-time professional children’s entertainer and award-winning magician, I love amazing audiences, making children laugh and creating unforgettable memories.\n\nFrom birthday parties, Communions and christenings to weddings, corporate events, Christmas parties and festivals, I bring every occasion to life with incredible magic, hilarious comedy, face painting, balloon modelling and lots of audience participation.\n\nHappy children. Huge smiles. Magical memories!\n\n✨ Let’s make your next celebration extra special.\n\nContact me today!  0872616317\n\n​\n\n​\n\nFollow us on Instagram\n#wix\n@magiciandublin\nBOOK NOW\nFACE PAINTING\n\nI am a professional face painter and I cover face painting events all over Ireland....\n\nI am available for Childrens Birthday Parties, Christenings, Weddings, Fun Days, Shows, In-store promotions, Halloween Parties, Theme Nights, Corporate events, Christmas Parties, Festivals and more. In fact anywhere children need entertaining!\n\nBALLOON \n  MODELLING\n\nWhether it is pirate swords, dinosaurs, flowers, puppys or whatever your little one would like i can make it for them.\n\nContact me today for an event with a twist!\n\n087-2616-317\n\nWeddings\n\nThinking of new and interesting ways to entertain your younger guests?\n\nChildren often tire of being quiet during the wedding reception and speeches. They often run about the tables messing around and who wouldn't at 4-8 years old! To a 4-8 year old sitting in your seat for over an hour is like a lifetime!\n\nThe performance is specifically tailored to your wedding ensuring that Magic Martas performance fits around your big day and uses the space and grounds of the wedding reception..\n\nCommunion\nEntertainment\n087-2616-317\n\nNow Booking for 2026 Communion Celebrations!\n\nIf you’re planning a special communion event and want to ensure the kids have an unforgettable time, now’s the perfect moment to secure an entertainer who brings joy, excitement, and engaging activities to the party.\n\n \n\n🎩 What's on offer:\n\nInteractive magic shows\n\nFun games and activities\n\nBalloon modelling\n\nAnd much more! \n\n \n\nContact me to reserve your date and discuss how we can make your communion celebration extra special!\n\nDon’t miss out on the chance to create lasting memories for your little one and their friends. Get in touch today to book Magic Marta and make your event truly magical!\n\nkids party entertainment\n\nmarts magic kids show\n\nmagician ireland\n\nmagician dublin\n\nkids show ireland\n\nkids party ideas\n\nballoon modelling\n\nchildrens birthday party ideas\n\nkids party entertainer\n\nchildrens party entertainers\n\nchildrens birthday party\n\nkids party entertainers\n\n1/4\n\n\"Great job, kept the kids entertained and stress free before their appoinment! The magic sweets helped lol!\"\n\nClaire - Woodstown Dental Centre\n\nWhat They Say\nCLIENTS\nGET IN TOUCH\n\nMarta's Magic Kids Show \n\nCo.Dublin\n\ninfo@martasmagic.com |  Tel: 087-2616-317\n\nSend\nTop\ninfo@martasmagic.com\n\n​\n\n© 2026 Marta's Magic Kids Show\n\n087-2616-317",
